.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/621020/extras/153bcf6531289924d90445c4fdf05bc3.mp4?t=1728468674\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><i>Split-screen gameplay</i><br><br><strong>Sabotage </strong>your fellow racers by activating hover mines, creating a rockslide to cause tunnels to collapse, firing missiles from rocket launchers along the track, and many more malicious tricks.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/621020/extras/31d8937a279676d5362e9ba8ccd1351f.poster.avif?t=1728468674\" width=620 height=140 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/621020/extras/31d8937a279676d5362e9ba8ccd1351f.webm?t=1728468674\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/621020/extras/31d8937a279676d5362e9ba8ccd1351f.mp4?t=1728468674\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Customize </strong>your Grav to your heart\u2019s content, but choose wisely: deciding on one upgrade may mean compromising on another. Strategically tailor-make your Grav to gain the upper hand in races or face the crushing prospect of defeat. In addition to the customization options, unlockable skins will be available free of charge.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/621020/extras/ed3d036a8cc27604b6b5f12db38c33d3.poster.avif?t=1728468674\" width=620 height=140 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/621020/extras/ed3d036a8cc27604b6b5f12db38c33d3.webm?t=1728468674\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/621020/extras/ed3d036a8cc27604b6b5f12db38c33d3.mp4?t=1728468674\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>In this futuristic high-octane racing game, defying gravity is the least of your concerns.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >KEY FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>No speed limit!<br></li><li>Play the single player campaign to unlock new parts, ships and skins<br></li><li>Race your friends with local split-screen multiplayer for up to 4 players<br></li><li>Challenge anybody in online multiplayer mode with rankings and leaderboards<br></li><li>Use environmental traps to overtake your opponents<br></li><li>Power-ups and boosts allow you to become top of the leaderboard<br></li><li>Ship customization gives you an edge over the opposition<br></li><li>Five beautifully created sci-fi worlds, each with three  dynamic courses <br></li><li>Stunning realistic 3D graphics powered by Unity<br></li><li>Soundtrack featuring 15 intense tracks that will enhance your racing experience</li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"icon":"0cdc6aedc3c2785405f347c3840af2e5193444cf.jpg","localized_name":"First Timer","name":"First Timer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/621020/0cdc6aedc3c2785405f347c3840af2e5193444cf.jpg"},{"icon":"c2376cfda9712061cc095fe7bebcb71b3cface93.jpg","localized_name":"Rocket-powered Rookie","name":"Rocket-powered Rookie","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/621020/c2376cfda9712061cc095fe7bebcb71b3cface93.jpg"},{"icon":"9ab33b90b340e347100cd9a406842eaa527bee07.jpg","localized_name":"Absolute Legend","name":"Absolute Legend","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/621020/9ab33b90b340e347100cd9a406842eaa527bee07.jpg"},{"icon":"d185a2530ae1c5108858e169a2835744c8e7bb48.jpg","localized_name":"Open for business","name":"Open for business","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/621020/d185a2530ae1c5108858e169a2835744c8e7bb48.jpg"},{"icon":"365dc65cc1d9ba47a10166973c1e552e2d72d5e1.jpg","localized_name":"Sold Out","name":"Sold Out","pa